Z||000014||Standard||01-05-2001||05:00 AM||||You don't have to replace the steering column.. be glad you won't have that retarded little key-release thingy.  Took me 10 minutes to figure out how to get the key out the first time...  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/rolleyes.gif"><P>You'll need the ECM.. Not sure, but you might want to check into the wiring of the backup lights.  Might need to change some connectors.  And if you want to do it totally perfect you'll need the clutch start safety switch thingamajobber.  And the little shift pattern sticker  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||
